FEX ThunkLibs (32-bit guests): return long and unsigned long in the guest's 32-bit size.

GuestWrapperForHostFunction (host functions a 32-bit guest gets through glXGetProcAddress) returns
long and unsigned long (XIDs such as GLXWindow) in the guest's 32-bit type, instead of writing 8
bytes into the guest's 4-byte return slot over its saved %ebx. A long return with a passthrough
annotation does not compile; no libGL function has one.

 ThunkLibs/include/common/Host.h | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ThunkLibs/include/common/Host.h b/ThunkLibs/include/common/Host.h
index 8415099..7e01c65 100644
